    "description": "What: CE-3094 tutorial demo - a Rifleman (BasicInfantrySop, ROE FireAtWill + StayOnTask) on a two-leg CombatPosture mission along Main Street, (300,215) to (242,226) to (200,330), meets Hostile 1-3 advancing up the street from (200,290-320) to (200,150) at 1.2 m/s. Shows posture + approach + mission composing against a group. Judge: (1) the approach behind Block C keeps him unseen for most of the walk (first hit after ~f4000); (2) the mission reaches its second leg; (3) his rounds reach SimHost as bullets and at least one hostile loses health; (4) if hit, he picks a defensive posture and a wounded man keeps moving. He is not asserted to win. Fail: He is spotted early, never reaches leg two, or fires nothing. Check: none (no live check) - twin: PostureScenarioTests (CE3094_UniversalSoldier_MissionOfPostureLegs_AgainstAGroup)"
  },
